  "question": {
    "text": "How many <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>EDTA</mi></math> (ethylenediaminetetraacetate) unit(s) are required to make an octahedral complex with a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ca</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;ion?"
  },
